			dependencies: ["6CBF14462DF3EBD3"]
			icon: "minecraft:lever"
			title: "The Controls"
			subtitle: "Three keys this pack adds"
			description: [
				"Three things this pack does that vanilla does not, all worth knowing on day one."
				""
				"&6Claims:&r press &6M&r for the map, right-click a chunk and choose Claim. Nobody"
				"else can build, break or open chests inside it. Every player has an allowance."
				""
				"&6Ultimine:&r hold &6`&r and break one block of a vein or one log of a tree, and"
				"the rest comes with it, for the same hunger as mining by hand."
				""
				"&6Carry On:&r sneak-right-click a chest, furnace or machine with an empty hand to"
				"pick it up with everything still inside. Most animals can be carried the same way."
			]
